{"title":"Water wheel/1","sourceTitle":"Water wheel/1/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Uma <b>roda d'água</b> é um gerador de energia mecânica que extrai torque da água que flui rapidamente. É uma alternativa ao <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Windmill\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Windmill\">windmill</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Windmill\" title=\"Windmill\"> </a></span> para condução de uma rede <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical_power\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical power\">mechanical power</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mechanical_power\" title=\"Mechanical power\"> </a></span>, e foi introduzido na versão 1.22 junto com os blocos <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Small_4-way_hub\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Small 4-way hub\">small 4-way hub</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Small_4-way_hub\" title=\"Small 4-way hub\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rapidly_flowing_water\" class=\"new\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rapidly flowing water (page does not exist)\">rapidly flowing water</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rapidly_flowing_water&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Rapidly flowing water (page does not exist)\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 85/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 772/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 360/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.093      1 -total\n 94.90%    1.037      4 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183750-0!canonical a